        "id": 16766,
        "name": "Techywarrior",
        "username": "Techywarrior",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/cc9497/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-21T01:52:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span lang=\"EN\">I recently found Sentinels of the Multiverse and immediately fell in love with the game. Within a week I think I purchased almost all the expansions and mini expansion decks (haven't really tried Vengeance style yet so missing Villains of the Multiverse).</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN\">As a new player I found there is a lot to keep track of and figured there had to be a better way... and of course there is. Sentinels Sidekick looks like it would be really handy. Only problem is is that it's iOS and Android only and my tablet is Windows 10. With no plans to release a Windows 10 version (I got a nice email response from Handelabra Games) I decided I'd make something myself.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN\">So, without further ado, I'd like to introduce to the community my companion app.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN\">https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/p/sotm-companion/9nzstt0655d5</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN\">Since I am very very new to the game I am pretty sure I am missing important things and it's been a struggle to get any sort of consistent art. But I think the app is still useful right now and will only get better as I add new features and updates to it.</span></p><p><b><span lang=\"EN\">Features (currently)</span></b></p><ul>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">Create random games based on given criteria</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">Create random games based on difficulty</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">Create custom games</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">Track hero and villain HP</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">Track hero and villain effects</span></li>\n</ul><p><span lang=\"EN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><b><span lang=\"EN\">Known Issues</span></b></p><ul>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">Missing some artwork for heroes and villains</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">I used the data from the Sentinels Difficulty Score System by Matthew Gray but I just found out there is a more up to date Sentinels Statistics project so I don't know how good my data is.</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"EN\">(more, but I don't know them yet)</span></li>\n</ul><p><span lang=\"EN\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN\">I did list it with a nominal cost of $0.99 but I feel that it gives good value at the moment and will only get better over time. I hope you guys check it out and I welcome any feedback that can help make SotM Companion a better app to help players with the game.</span></p><p><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></p>",
