        "raw": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">I recently found Sentinels of the Multiverse and immediately fell in love with the game. Within a week I think I purchased almost all the expansions and mini expansion decks (haven&#39;t really tried Vengeance style yet so missing Villains of the Multiverse).</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">As a new player I found there is a lot to keep track of and figured there had to be a better way... and of course there is. Sentinels Sidekick looks like it would be really handy. Only problem is is that it&#39;s iOS and Android only and my tablet is Windows 10. With no plans to release a Windows 10 version (I got a nice email response from Handelabra Games) I decided I&#39;d make something myself.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">So, without further ado, I&#39;d like to introduce to the community my companion app.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/store/p/sotm-companion/9nzstt0655d5</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Since I am very very new to the game I am pretty sure I am missing important things and it&#39;s been a struggle to get any sort of consistent art. But I think the app is still useful right now and will only get better as I add new features and updates to it.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Features (currently)</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\"><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Create random games based on given criteria</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Create random games based on difficulty</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Create custom games</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Track hero and villain HP</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Track hero and villain effects</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Known Issues</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\"><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Missing some artwork for heroes and villains</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">I used the data from the Sentinels Difficulty Score System by Matthew Gray but I just found out there is a more up to date Sentinels Statistics project so I don&#39;t know how good my data is.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 15pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">(more, but I don&#39;t know them yet)</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px; line-height: 15pt;\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">I did list it with a nominal cost of $0.99 but I feel that it gives good value at the moment and will only get better over time. I hope you guys check it out and I welcome any feedback that can help make SotM Companion a better app to help players with the game.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10.66px;\"><font face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></p>",
